  "core_design_rules": [
    "Sage is not a stronger Magician; it is a more technical one.",
    "The class emphasizes magical analysis, anti-caster utility, weapon enchantment, and terrain control.",
    "Arcane Technique defines how the Sage behaves in combat through stances rather than passive-only bonuses.",
    "Auto Spell uses Trigger Bolt instead of the full Element Bolt spell.",
    "Professor identity emerges through higher-level control tools like Geomantic Field and Arcane Denial.",
    "Abracadabra is intentionally excluded due to excessive system complexity for this implementation."
